    :hasLanguage :English ;
    :hasKeywordAbility :Flying ;
    :hasKeywordAction :Transform ;
    :printedText """This artifact enters with three omen counters on it.
{1}{U}, {T}: Look at the top two cards of your library. Put one of them into your graveyard.
Whenever a creature card is put into your graveyard from anywhere, remove an omen counter from this artifact. Then if it has no omen counters on it, transform it.
//
Flying
This creature can block only creatures with flying.
{3}{U}: Draw two cards, then discard a card."""@en ;
    :oracleText """This artifact enters with three omen counters on it.
{1}{U}, {T}: Look at the top two cards of your library. Put one of them into your graveyard.
Whenever a creature card is put into your graveyard from anywhere, remove an omen counter from this artifact. Then if it has no omen counters on it, transform it.
//
Flying
This creature can block only creatures with flying.
{3}{U}: Draw two cards, then discard a card."""@en ;
    :flavorText """Rather than consort with demons, the Quietus Cult seeks wisdom from the dead."""@en ;
    :gathererUrl "https://gatherer.wizards.com/Pages/Card/Details.aspx?multiverseid=685912"^^xsd:anyURI ;
    :scryfallUrl "https://scryfall.com/card/inr/85/soulcipher-board-cipherbound-spirit"^^xsd:anyURI ;
    :hasLegality
      [ rdf:type :LegalityMapping ; :inFormat :Commander ; :hasLegalityStatus :Legal ] ,
      [ rdf:type :LegalityMapping ; :inFormat :Standard ; :hasLegalityStatus :NotLegal ] ,
      [ rdf:type :LegalityMapping ; :inFormat :Modern ; :hasLegalityStatus :Legal ] ,
      [ rdf:type :LegalityMapping ; :inFormat :Legacy ; :hasLegalityStatus :Legal ] ,
      [ rdf:type :LegalityMapping ; :inFormat :Vintage ; :hasLegalityStatus :Legal ] ,
      [ rdf:type :LegalityMapping ; :inFormat :Pioneer ; :hasLegalityStatus :Legal ] ,
      [ rdf:type :LegalityMapping ; :inFormat :Pauper ; :hasLegalityStatus :NotLegal ] ;
    :hasRuling
      [ rdf:type :Ruling ;
        :rulingDate "2021-11-19"^^xsd:date ;
        :rulingText """Soulcipher Board's last ability triggers when a creature card is put into a graveyard from anywhere. This is different than an ability that triggers when a creature dies. Notably, a noncreature card on the battlefield that becomes a creature and dies (such as an animated land) won't cause this ability to trigger. Similarly, a creature card on the battlefield that has been made a noncreature permanent (such as one enchanted with Minimus Containment) will cause this ability to trigger when that card is put into your graveyard."""@en ] ,
      [ rdf:type :Ruling ;
        :rulingDate "2021-11-19"^^xsd:date ;
        :rulingText """Token creatures dying never cause Soulcipher Board's last ability to trigger."""@en ] .

